{"id": "t013-001", "text": "ayo's bday is the 14th, he's really into vinyl atm esp old highlife and fela stuff. his girlfriend afua said he already has most of the obvious ones so maybe something rare from the shop on brick lane. remind me to go look sat morning b4 then, and get a card", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "ayo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 14th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "vinyl", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "old highlife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "fela", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "afua", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "already has most of the obvious ones", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "something rare from the shop on brick lane", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "go look", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sat morning", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "b4 then", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get a card", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
